You should consider not to believe everything you read in a wiki.
Or I should consider not to trust my experience and the nethack
source code I just consulted . The first statement in clone_mon()
(used for monster pudding division) is:

| if (mon->mhp <= 1
|  || (mvitals[monsndx(mon->data)].mvflags & G_EXTINCT))
|     return (struct monst *)0;

And no, it does not help to polymorph into a pudding and invite
monsters to divide you, either.

